            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Devkitty 1.0.0 (build 280)</h2>
<ul>
<li>Less memory for hidden terminals: when a terminal is hidden (another tab, a minimized window, Cmd-H or another Space), Devkitty frees its graphics memory. It is drawn again when you show it.</li>
<li>Less CPU: workspaces with split panes no longer re-measure their layout on every screen update. In a test, idle CPU dropped from about 39% to 24%; your numbers can differ.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
